	(text "Revision A    Date 2026-11-25    Doc No RR-EL-0101\n\nVL53L4ED time-of-flight ranging sensor on a small carrier; used 11x on the robot\n(cliff, look-ahead, rear proximity). I2C pull-ups are on the main board, not here.\nSensor on the top side, connector on the bottom side (mounts flush behind a window).\n\nLayers: 2    Thickness: 1.60 mm\nRails: +3V3, +3V3_TOF, GND\nNet class PWR: track 0.30 mm, clearance 0.15 mm, via 0.60/0.30 mm  [+3V3, +3V3_TOF, GND]\n\nThis schematic is generated from board.py by tools/eda (rrkicad).\nAll nets are connected by name (global labels / power symbols); there are no drawn wires between symbols."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
